---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh" page="download" title="下载 Opaline - Public alpha" description="下载 Opaline v0.1.2，并阅读构建与更新说明。">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">v0.1.2 public alpha</p>
      <h1>下载 Opaline</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Opaline 当前处于 public alpha。当前 Release 已提供 Windows 和 macOS Apple Silicon 构建，发布包可能仍未签名或未公证。</p>
      <div class="page-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/miqiv99/opaline/releases/tag/v0.1.2" rel="noreferrer">打开 GitHub Release</a>
        <a class="button" href="/zh/docs/release">构建与更新说明</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell content-grid">
      <article class="notice">
        <h2>安装前请知道</h2>
        <ul class="fine-list">
          <li>用重要笔记测试 alpha 版本前，请先备份工作区。</li>
          <li>v0.1.2 已提供 Windows 和 macOS Apple Silicon 资产。</li>
          <li>Windows 仍是主要开发目标；macOS 安装包在 macOS 上构建和测试。</li>
          <li>未签名或未公证安装包可能触发 Windows SmartScreen、Gatekeeper 或其他系统安全提醒。</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="license-box">
        <h2>更新状态</h2>
        <p>设置页已经有手动检查更新 UI。当前 GitHub Release 更新元数据覆盖 Windows x64 和 macOS Apple Silicon 资产。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
